# Keep generated and local-only paths out of release tarballs.
# `upstream/` is re-extracted from the installed Console by `kgx-patch.py dump`,
# so it is never something to commit.
#
# Note: pkg/ and debian/ are deliberately NOT export-ignored. `pkg/build-release.sh`
# builds one tarball with `git archive` and both packaging systems build from it, so
# the tarball has to carry both recipes to stay self-contained.
__pycache__/ export-ignore
*.pyc         export-ignore
upstream/     export-ignore
*.tar.gz      export-ignore